<%#
# The password of a person just added to the account

Shown on the card in the response to «Добавить пользователя» when the person got a password you set: ONCE, with «Скопировать». The response is
the POST itself, nothing keeps the password, the browser is told not to either.

## Local variables:

- `member`: the `SuperAdmin::AccountMember` that was just added (with a password to show).
%>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-2 border-b border-n-weak px-5 py-4" data-testid="added-member-password" data-password-widget>
  <p class="m-0 font-medium text-n-slate-12"><%= t('super_admin.onboarding.member.password_for', email: member.user.email) %></p>
  <p class="admin-block__hint m-0"><%= t('super_admin.onboarding.created.password_once') %></p>
  <%= render 'super_admin/shared/sign_in_details', email: member.user.email, password: member.one_time_password, prefix: 'member' %>
</div>
<%= render 'super_admin/shared/password_script' %>
